ess celebration of  infantile trolling the reposting of  plagiarized memes  the copy and pasting of pepe the frog  and habits like the mindlessly  gratuitous use of the word cuck  it doesn't make them clever it doesn't  make them thinkers  for example look below this video  at the kids who have just pitifully  reproduced  asinine memes phrases and concepts  that they've learned or outright copied  from other people  they have nothing to say they have no  intellectual arguments they are sheep  and they pretend that their unorganized  allegiance to others who similarly  create  outrage is something that gives them  validity  as if it makes them witty it is a  cop-out put aside the bankruptcy of  their so-called philosophies  and just look at their tactics the way  they communicate  the way that they relay ideas to one  another  and to people with whom they disagree  there's no mistaking them  they are the most anti-intellectual  unimaginative and  easily identifiable group of drones on  the internet
 

