 has as a movement  people who identify as alt-right are  almost universally biased against both  muslims  and jews but like i said alt-writers are  not necessarily christians across the  board  many are actually atheists but a  prevalent theme among them is their  fondness for the idea of what they like  to think of as  christian values which is another one of  these concepts that's hard to pin down  as a value system but it can probably be  best described  as an adherence to social conservatism  but interestingly at the same time  despite their love for right-wing  christianity's influence on the west  most within the alt-right embrace the  notion of evolution and many of them  adulterate the theory of evolution to  the point of using it to justify racism  claiming that there are human races or  sub-species  that sometimes are smarter more moral or  better than others  and of course they see white non-jews as  being the best  and they use non-scientific quackery to  come to these conclusions again  obviously there's nothing new or  interesting about these ideas there's  just a new loud group on the internet  called the alt-right that's touting this  outdated nonsense  the one and only redeeming quality of  the alt-right  is their commitment against political  correctness and identity politics to the  extent that it's destructive  i'm actively looking for a silver lining  here and this is at least  something we've talked on the show about  this plenty of times about how  authoritarian leftism  would some refer to as the regressive  left can be totally counterproductive in  how it stifles conversation about a  number of things  whether it be race islam feminism  but this is what i truly find to be most  ironic and hypocritical about the  alt-right  how they try to use political  correctness and identity politics  with respect to white people and men  people in the alt-right go around saying  that women  and ethnic minorities and religious  minorities rely  too much on acting as victims and trying  to censor discourse  but then the alt-right hilariously just  turns around  and moans about how badly whites and  males  are victimized and how important white  identity is how important  male identity is and they aggressively  attack  and shun those who disagree with them  about these things  they are so perfectly guilty of what  they constantly accuse  other groups of doing in terms of  identity politics political correctness  playing the victim card and they often  go as far  as to talk about white genocide  so maybe you're on the alt-right and  you're thinking well every other group  acts like a victim and celebrates their  identity  isn't it time for white people and men  to do the same doesn't that just level  the playing field  but that is exactly what the alt-right  criticizes  groups like women and minorities for  doing themselves  besides are men and white people the  real victims in this country  or in the world the attitude of the  alt-right is a prime example of identity  politics if there ever was one  centered around white non-jewish male  tribalism  another important thing to remember is  that the alt-right only has an identity  because of their commonality  as trolls they claim to be a unified  movement but they are as amorphous as  any other  trivial set of collective activities on  the internet  they derive their legitimacy from their  common goal of trying to offend and get  a rise out of people are  any other serious ideological movements  centered around  indecency for the sake of indecency for  the most part  the only thing that gives alt-right  internet foot soldiers any power  at all is their anonymity and their  unoriginal reliance  on sharing things like animated gifs and  tired terms and slogans  it is a textbook example of groupthink  the alt-right as a whole is a failed  homemade attempt to rebrand and  legitimize white supremacy  misogyny and anti-semitism with a tech  savviness twist  through the mindless celebration of  infantile trolling the reposting of  plagiarized memes  the copy and pasting of pepe the frog  and habits like the mindlessly  gratuitous use of the word cuck  it doesn't make them clever it doesn't  make them thinkers  for example look below this video  at the kids who have just pitifully  reproduced  asinine memes phrases and concepts  that they've learned or outright copied  from other people  they have nothing to say they have no  intellectual arguments they are sheep  and they pretend that their unorganized  allegiance to others who similarly  create  outrage is something that gives them  validity  as if it makes them witty it is a  cop-out put aside the bankruptcy of  their so-called philosophies  and just look at their tactics the way  they communicate  the way that they relay ideas to one  another  and to people with whom they disagree  there's no mistaking them  they are the most anti-intellectual  unimaginative and  easily identifiable group of drones on  the internet


